{"version":1,"content":"<p>希望利用一趟短線遊收穫滿滿的幸福感？</p><p>浙江麗水是理想地點，它被譽為「江南最後秘境」，山水如畫，既可欣賞高山梯田、雲海日落，還可乘坐建於海拔近700米的山頂摩天輪、品嘗山珍海錯、走進童話小鎮、閒逛歷史街區，全是體驗慢活樂趣的加油站，讓人難以忘懷</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-19T07:23:56.367753+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":121,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-19T07:00:53+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-19T07:17:13.558559+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-19T07:17:13.558559+00:00","content_hash":"2c1cb17ac6d38f7a9a905543b240dfeef16d3c4fdce701271d787bcf9a9c34d9","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}